              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "50",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naagamba ati: Iguru nikyo kitebe kyange eky'obukama, kandi ensi, nuko katebe ak'ebigere byange, nju ki, ei musobora kunyombekera, kandi kiikaroki ekinsobora kuhuumurramu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu ebi byona, ninyowe nabikozire habweki, ebi byona byange. Baitu omuntu ou nditaho eriiso, nuwe ogu arukwebundaaza ow'omwoyo ogurukweteera, kandi anyakuhurra ekigambo kyange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu anyakwita ente, asisana n'oli anyakwita omuntu; anyakutamba ekyana ky'entaama, asisana n'oli anyakumyora embwa ebikya; anyakuhonga ekihongwa eky'ebyokulya, asisana n'oli anyakuhonga esagama y'empunu; ogu anyakuhonga ekihongwa eky'okwijukirwaho eky'obubbani asisana nk'oli anyakuhaisaniza ekisisani. Abantu abo bakeecwera amagezi gaabo bonka kandi emitima yabo neesiima ebibi byabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na nyowe ndibakomera omuhito, mbaleetere ebi batiina muno; habwokuba obunayesire, hatabeho n'omu ayagarukiremu, obu nabalize, batahulirize; baitu bakakora ebimbiihiza, kandi baasiima ebi ntagonza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe abanyakutiina MUKAMA kandi abanyakumuhurra, muhurre ekigamho kye. Bagenzi banyu abanyakubanoba bakabanaga aheeru habwange, bakagamba bati: MUKAMA akugizibwe, nukwo turole omuhimbo gwanyu; baitu bbo, nubo balihemurwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hurra obwogo obunyakuli omurubuga! Hurra oburukuruga omunju ya Ruhanga, iraka lya MUKAMA arukusasura abanyanzigwa be!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
